  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Early Response Mechanism (ERM) II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The ERM II will allow for immediate financial support in the first stages of a crisis, namely in the preparation of a PSO or initial steps of a mediation process, when urgent funding is required.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
